WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:06.029
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do: No bets concerning XK-Class End of the

00:00:06.029 --> 00:00:07.779
World Scenarios!

00:00:07.779 --> 00:00:13.179
It's the one thing we hope to avoid: An XK
Class Scenario, an event that results in the

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:15.719
complete and utter destruction of the world.

00:00:15.719 --> 00:00:20.500
Most of us prefer not to think about it at
all, unless we're actively trying to prevent

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.500
it.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.580
Not Dr. Bright, though.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:26.040
He sees the apocalypse as a chance to make
a quick buck!

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:30.970
Dr. Bright is officially prohibited from making,
accepting, or taking any rake-off bets related

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:33.340
to XK Class Scenarios.

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:37.610
These include, but are not limited to, "I'll
bet you a thousand bucks the robots get us

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:42.440
first," "it'll all start with ducks," and
"not with a bang, but with a whimper."

